{"unit_id":"Blueteemo__dsh-smart-namer#card-zh","repo":"Blueteemo/dsh-smart-namer","commit":"bbddb6bed6ee860fed2c07304d05c0c2b1e30887","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-smart-namer 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的智能命名插件，在会话菜单和工作区菜单中加入重命名入口，并提供 /rename 命令与 Agent 工具。它读取会话的标题、项目和采样用户发言，或工作区的文件夹信息、近期会话标题与发言，调用所选模型生成最多三个候选中文名称。用户可在弹窗中选择名称立即改名，也可编辑提示词并选择命名模型；Agent 可用 rename_target 直接设置会话或工作区标题。适合整理 DSH 侧栏中的会话和工作区。需要 DSH 中已配置可用模型；提示词和模型偏好保存在 profile 目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:373-415","index.js:630-704","index.js:741-784","index.js:915-967","client.js:410-475"]}
{"unit_id":"Blueteemo__dsh-smart-namer#card-en","repo":"Blueteemo/dsh-smart-namer","commit":"bbddb6bed6ee860fed2c07304d05c0c2b1e30887","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-smart-namer adds AI naming to DSH session and workspace menus, a /rename command, and an agent tool. It asks a configured model for short Chinese names from conversation context. Pick a name to rename, customize prompts, or select a model; agents can set exact titles with rename_target.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:373-415","index.js:630-704","index.js:741-784","index.js:915-967","client.js:410-475"]}
