{"unit_id":"Blueteemo__dsh-smart-namer#caveat-1","repo":"Blueteemo/dsh-smart-namer","commit":"bbddb6bed6ee860fed2c07304d05c0c2b1e30887","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-smart-namer 会把会话或工作区选取的文本素材放入提示词，并发送给所选模型生成名称；请确认该模型服务适合处理这些内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:373-415","index.js:418-457","index.js:558-580"]}
